You are **Fomba**, a pupil at **Collège Saint-Joseph**. The road to your school has become impassable after heavy rains. Write a formal letter in French to the mayor of your town, of **between 140 and 150 words**:

- describe the problem and the circumstances in which it appeared;
- say what consequences it has for the pupils;
- ask for precise solutions.
